						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#369">Helping New players/Characters</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							Anyone needing a bit of PLing a new character tonight (3/5/2002) give me a tell and I will get you to GFAY to assist with the Shammy. I am presently teaching a VERY new player how the game works. It only took me 2.5 hours to get him to get trained and equip his sword (Ranger) and destroy the book. Finally got him down off the platforms in Kelethin and tonight I will be teaching him to set up Hot-Keys and buttons for general use. So if you are starting a new character (Lvls 1-6) give me a tell and I will get you to Gfay and buff you so you will be able to fly through 1-4 and possibly 1-6.<br />
<br />
Teaching someone in-game is hard as hell :(<br />
<br />
Later all.
