					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							People,<br />
<br />
Please try to keep your postings on the threads in what few actual headings we have so far. If a new one (subject) is needed then please make one so all people can post the same subject matter under that thread. <br />
<br />
Personal postings are great for conveying information to each other but creating a new thread for each one will cause this page to get rather large very quickly. And since we can't wipe (to my knowledge) out old threads as they become irrelevant they just stack up and make reading this page difficult. Even I am guilty of this and will try to keep anything I post in the future under specific headings :) <br />
<br />
Thanks all.<br />
<br />
Buu
