					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							I want to give everyone a warm welcome to our NEW family :) We have changed the rules of recruiting a bit to weed out some of the bad seeds that joined us in DE.  No longer is just anyone allowed to join, unless it is an alt., now anyone that is over lvl 20 that wants to join EMF needs to group with me and at least one other officer and then I will talk with the other officers and we will make the decision together.  Also if someone continues to fall out of the rules of the guild then you will be removed after the second offense.  I do believe that this is customary for other guilds as well.  Again I want to thank all of those that helped me get EMF started and welcome to the new ones that joined us.!  See you all online :)<br />
<br />
Gen
